      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.70 (down from ₹13.03 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹705.5m (up 31% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹42.2m (down 10% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.0% (down from 8.8% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 4% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
